    <h1>Best Nonstop Routes from Canada: YYZ, YVR, YUL and YYC</h1>
    <p>Canadian travelers have more nonstop options than most realize — but coverage varies significantly by airport. Here is where you can fly direct from each of Canada's major hubs.</p>
